<https://terrafabric.world/id/cli/tfab/command/graph-sparql> a tf:RemoteCliCommand ;
    schema:description "Read-only SPARQL 1.1 over the full TerraFabric graph (ontology + catalog). Use PREFIX tf: <https://terrafabric.world/ont#> and tfr: <https://terrafabric.world/id/>. SELECT/ASK return SPARQL JSON results (capped at 10,000 rows, flagged truncated); CONSTRUCT/DESCRIBE return Turtle. Updates and SERVICE are refused." ;
